{
  "audio": "pixar_intro_short_clean.mp3",
  "title": "The Secrets of Longevity — Seven Decades of Service (short)",
  "titleMain": "THE SECRETS OF LONGEVITY",
  "titleSub": "SEVEN DECADES OF SERVICE",
  "tagline": "Your days are numbered. Make them count.",
  "cta": "Begins this July · @KidsInspiringNation",
  "titleAt": 74.3,
  "tail": 0.5,
  "beats": [
    {
      "i": 0,
      "start": 0,
      "end": 12.92,
      "vo": "What if the secret to a long life wasn't found in medicine, or money, or even genetics? Think about this for a moment.",
      "hero": "beat0_hero.png",
      "depth": "beat0_hero_depth.png",
      "veo": "beat0_veo.mp4",
      "motion": "push-in"
    },
    {
      "i": 1,
      "start": 12.92,
      "end": 20.4,
      "vo": "If you lived to be a hundred years old, you would have only thirty-six thousand five hundred days.",
      "hero": "beat5_hero.png",
      "depth": "beat5_hero_depth.png",
      "veo": "beat5_veo.mp4",
      "motion": "dolly-right"
    },
    {
      "i": 2,
      "start": 20.4,
      "end": 32.88,
      "vo": "The equivalent of eight hundred and seventy-six thousand hours. Nobody leaves this earth with a million hours in the bank. Time is God's most valuable gift.",
      "hero": "beat6_hero.png",
      "depth": "beat6_hero_depth.png",
      "veo": "beat6_veo.mp4",
      "motion": "push-in"
    },
    {
      "i": 3,
      "start": 32.88,
      "end": 44.72,
      "vo": "So the real question is not how long will I live, but how well can I live.",
      "hero": "beat7_hero.png",
      "depth": "beat7_hero_depth.png",
      "veo": null,
      "motion": "pull-back"
    },
    {
      "i": 4,
      "start": 44.72,
      "end": 55.4,
      "vo": "Abraham, a hundred and seventy-five years. Isaac, a hundred and eighty. Jacob, a hundred and forty-seven. What was it that made them?",
      "hero": "beat9_hero.png",
      "depth": "beat9_hero_depth.png",
      "veo": null,
      "motion": "dolly-right"
    },
    {
      "i": 5,
      "start": 55.4,
      "end": 63.48,
      "vo": "Was it history? Or does God have something to teach us about living long, fruitful, satisfying lives?",
      "hero": "beat12_hero.png",
      "depth": "beat12_hero_depth.png",
      "veo": "beat12_veo.mp4",
      "motion": "orbit"
    },
    {
      "i": 6,
      "start": 63.48,
      "end": 70.68,
      "vo": "With long life will I satisfy him, and show him my salvation. God's desire is not simply that you live longer,",
      "hero": "beat4_hero.png",
      "depth": "beat4_hero_depth.png",
      "veo": null,
      "motion": "crane-up"
    },
    {
      "i": 7,
      "start": 70.68,
      "end": 80.5,
      "vo": "but that you live for his glory. Welcome to The Secrets of Longevity — Seven Decades of Service.",
      "hero": "beat15_hero.png",
      "depth": "beat15_hero_depth.png",
      "veo": null,
      "motion": "push-in"
    }
  ],
